00:30:15.995 --> 00:30:17.317
Related ADRs:

441
00:30:17.597 --> 00:30:38.909
ADR-048 Orchestrated checkout saga; ADR-049 Transactional outbox with polling relay (CDC later); ADR-050 Inbox dedup for all consumers; ADR-051 Stock holds with expiry; ADR-052 No XA across services.

442
00:30:40.259 --> 00:30:40.899
1.

443
00:30:41.179 --> 00:30:42.587
Context and Problem.

444
00:30:42.867 --> 00:30:47.113
Checkout spans order, inventory and payment services plus Razorpay.

445
00:30:47.393 --> 00:31:00.790
The current @Transactional method produced charged-without-order (1,140), stuck stock (380 units), lost events (212 orders) and double charges (§1.1).

446
00:31:01.070 --> 00:31:06.467
An XA pilot blocked inventory rows for 11 minutes during a coordinator restart.

447
00:31:06.747 --> 00:31:07.451
2.

448
00:31:07.731 --> 00:31:09.075
Goals or Non-Goals.

449
00:31:10.425 --> 00:31:27.535
Goals: no customer charged without an order or a refund; no stock lost or oversold; every order event delivered to every consumer, with its effect applied once; recovery from any single crash without manual steps; every checkout's state visible in one place.

450
00:31:27.815 --> 00:31:40.273
Non-goals: cross-service isolation (accepted: holds are visible, §2.8); real-time analytics consistency (CDC to the warehouse is eventual, Ch 21).

451
00:31:40.553 --> 00:31:41.300
3.

452
00:31:41.580 --> 00:31:42.540
Requirements.

453
00:31:43.890 --> 00:31:45.234
Here is a quick table:

454
00:31:45.514 --> 00:31:46.986
ID, and Requirement.

455
00:31:47.266 --> 00:31:48.311
NFR-1:

456
00:31:48.591 --> 00:31:54.650
0 orders violating the cross-service invariants (checked nightly by a reconciliation job).

457
00:31:54.930 --> 00:31:55.975
NFR-2:

458
00:31:56.255 --> 00:31:58.666
A crashed checkout resumes within 60 s.

459
00:31:58.946 --> 00:32:00.013
NFR-3:

460
00:32:00.293 --> 00:32:07.482
Event delivery: at least once, lag p99 at most 2 s; effect exactly once in every consumer.

461
00:32:07.762 --> 00:32:08.850
NFR-4:

462
00:32:09.130 --> 00:32:14.143
Checkout p99 at most 1.5 s (dominated by Razorpay).

463
00:32:14.423 --> 00:32:15.469
NFR-5:

464
00:32:15.749 --> 00:32:20.783
A hold not confirmed within TTL is released within TTL + 30 s.

465
00:32:21.063 --> 00:32:22.151
NFR-6:

466
00:32:22.431 --> 00:32:26.741
No retry may create a second capture (idempotency key per saga).

467
00:32:28.091 --> 00:32:28.795
