Outbox payloads end up in Kafka and in the warehouse (CDC).

936
01:06:13.679 --> 01:06:22.255
Apply data minimization (no card data, masked PII), and encrypt sensitive fields (Ch 23, Ch 36).

937
01:06:23.605 --> 01:06:27.359
A CDC connector reads the database's full change stream.

938
01:06:27.639 --> 01:06:34.167
Give it a dedicated replication role restricted to a publication for the outbox table, not superuser.

939
01:06:35.517 --> 01:06:37.181
